# machine translation: argos 26d659f23a12
msgid "Installation & Configuration"
msgstr "Installation et configuration"

# machine translation: argos 17e54a6e05ba
msgid "A working aXqua installation consists of four parts, which are installed in this order:"
msgstr "Une installation aXqua de travail se compose de quatre parties, qui sont installées dans cet ordre :"

# machine translation: argos 7a3c399aa6f8
msgid "**QGIS and the aXqua plugin**, which is the user interface (:doc:`qgis-plugin`)."
msgstr "**QGIS et l'extension aXqua**, qui est l'interface utilisateur (:doc:`qgis-plugin`)."

# machine translation: argos bb1d50fe5064
msgid "**Simulation software**, which is TELEMAC and optionally OpenFOAM. aXqua writes the input files for these codes and starts them, but does not contain them (:doc:`simulation-software`)."
msgstr "**Logiciel de simulation**, qui est TELEMAC et optionnellement OpenFOAM. aXqua écrit les fichiers d'entrée pour ces codes et les lance, mais ne les contient pas (:doc:`simulation-software`)."

# machine translation: argos 8a25260e5b09
msgid "**The plugin setup**, which tells aXqua where the simulation software is installed on the computer in use (:doc:`plugin-setup`)."
msgstr "**La configuration de l'extension**, qui indique aXqua où le logiciel de simulation est installé sur l'ordinateur utilisé (:doc:`plugin-setup`)."

# machine translation: argos 30c203e2123d
msgid "**Postprocessors**, which are VisIt and ParaView for three-dimensional figures. They are optional (:doc:`postprocessors`)."
msgstr "**Les postprocesseurs**, qui sont VisIt et ParaView pour les figures tridimensionnelles. Ils sont facultatifs (:doc:`postprocessors`)."
